          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziyaanis abbootii isaa wajjin boqotee sababii namoonni, \"Inni lamxii qaba\" jedhaniif inni lafa awwaala moototaa keessatti isaanuma biratti ni awwaalame. Ilmi isaa Yootaam iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
